---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Body Care and Workout Recovery App';
const description = 'Body care, mobility and recovery routines to support better movement, reduce soreness and build long-term consistency.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
<section class="page-hero coral-bg"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow coral-text">Body Care</div><h1>Recovery and mobility work to keep people moving well.</h1><p class="lead">Body Care is the recovery side of the app. It gives users simple routines that can be completed after training or on rest days.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="container"><article><h2>Why body care matters</h2><p>Training works best when the body can recover, adapt and keep moving. Body care content should focus on mobility, recovery routines, injury prevention basics, warmups, cooldowns, stretching, soreness, and movement quality.</p><div class="callout coral-border">Content angle: recovery is not optional. It is part of the training system.</div><h2>Recommended content under this pillar</h2><ul><li><a href="/recovery/mobility-recovery-after-workouts/">Mobility and recovery after workouts</a></li><li><a href="/workplace-wellness/workplace-ergonomics/">Workplace ergonomics guide</a></li><li><a href="/guides/fitness-nutrition-mental-health-recovery-app/">Fitness, nutrition, mental health and recovery app guide</a></li></ul></article></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
